# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
# The boot class path's Java libraries (core-oj, core-libart, okhttp, ...), as
# art_standalone's make builds them: the Java steps of its dry run, with acp as
# cp -p and dx as $DX (port/art/dx-via-d8). The jars do not depend on the host,
# so a Darwin build makes them without the rest of make. Run in the ART tree:
#
#   R8_JAR=r8.jar DX=port/art/dx-via-d8 bash javalibs.sh
#   -> out/host/linux-x86/framework/*-hostdex.jar
set -e
rm -f out/host/common/obj/JAVA_LIBRARIES/core-all-hostdex_intermediates/classes-full-debug.jar
rm -rf out/host/common/obj/JAVA_LIBRARIES/core-all-hostdex_intermediates/classes
